  "description": "<p data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"425\">Ontdek de tropische Alola-regio in <em data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"257\">Pokémon Moon</em> voor de <strong data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"282\">Nintendo 3DS</strong>! Vang nieuwe Pokémon, neem het op tegen Team Skull en ervaar een vernieuwde Pokémon-formule met Island Trials in plaats van traditionele gyms.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"569\">Deze uitvoering betreft de <strong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"469\">Fan Edition</strong> en wordt geleverd <strong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"521\">inclusief originele steelbook</strong> — een extra mooie toevoeging voor verzamelaars.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"574\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"600\">📦 Productinformatie</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"860\">\r\n<li data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"631\">\r\n<p data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"631\"><strong data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"616\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo 3DS</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"659\">\r\n<p data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"659\"><strong data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"644\">Titel:</strong> Pokémon Moon</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"691\">\r\n<p data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"691\"><strong data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"677\">Uitvoering:</strong> Fan Edition</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"740\">\r\n<p data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"740\"><strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"704\">Extra:</strong> <strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"738\">Inclusief originele steelbook</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"771\">\r\n<p data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"771\"><strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"753\">Genre:</strong> RPG / Adventure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"835\">\r\n<p data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"835\"><strong data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"789\">Speelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer (met online & lokale functies)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"860\">\r\n<p data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"860\"><strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"851\">Leeftijd:</strong> PEGI 7</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"865\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"878\">✅ Staat</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<li data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"901\">\r\n<p data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"901\">Originele gamecard</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"928\">\r\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"928\"><strong data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"926\">Steelbook aanwezig</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<p data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"952\"><strong data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"950\">Doosje aanwezig</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"986\">\r\n<p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"986\"><strong data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"984\">Boekje / inserts aanwezig</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\n<p data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1017\">Getest en volledig werkend</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1033\">Nette staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1066\">🌙 Waarom deze editie?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1098\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1098\">Unieke steelbook uitvoering</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1131\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1131\">Introductie van Alola-vormen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1164\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1164\">Legendarische Pokémon Lunala</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1197\">Vernieuwde gameplaystructuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1237\">Extra interessant voor verzamelaars</p>\r\n</li